* @title Character pattern function examples
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 4
* @expect >>>
* A
* A
* UU
* AC
* SAMPLE
* TEN
* -43
* <<<
 'ABC' ANY('A') . OUTPUT
 'ABC' NOTANY('BC') . OUTPUT
 'UUA' SPAN('U') . OUTPUT
 'ACB' SPAN('AC') . OUTPUT
 'SAMPLE,TEN' BREAK(',') . OUTPUT
 'SAMPLE,TEN,' BREAK(',') LEN(1) BREAK(',') . OUTPUT
 'X-43Y' BREAK('-') (LEN(1) SPAN('0123456789')) . OUTPUT
END
